WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.601
Heating and cooling businesses rarely lose work for lack of calls. They lose it in the gaps between them. Here is the software our growth service runs for an HVAC business, problem by problem.

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:20.390
Leads arrive in five places: web forms, calls, ads and referrals. Nobody can say who is waiting, or where they came from.

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:28.677
In Protected Central every inquiry lands in one ledger, with its source kept from the first contact and its stage beside it.

00:00:30.777 --> 00:00:35.502
On the first hot day, the phone never stops, and web inquiries wait until evening.

00:00:37.102 --> 00:00:45.491
Speed to Lead answers each one from your own mailbox within minutes, and puts a call-back on today’s list. It runs on the server, every five minutes.

00:00:47.591 --> 00:00:50.609
Estimates go out after the visit, and nobody chases them.

00:00:52.209 --> 00:01:01.236
Every job sits in an HVAC pipeline, with days in stage on each card. Quote Follow-up chases each estimate three times over a fortnight, then stops.

00:01:06.209 --> 00:01:10.075
Visits are booked weeks apart, and a forgotten appointment is a wasted truck roll.

00:01:11.675 --> 00:01:17.875
Every visit sits on one week grid, and Appointment Reminder confirms each booking and reminds the customer the day before.

00:01:25.675 --> 00:01:31.039
Quotes, invoices and payments live in different places, so nobody knows which work actually paid.

00:01:32.639 --> 00:01:40.563
Open any job and see the inquiry, the quote, the completion and each payment, dated and signed. A payment only counts once you confirm it.

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:50.888
Last year’s customers sit in a database until they call somebody else.

00:01:52.488 --> 00:02:02.212
Every customer sits in one list with their stage, deals and source. Tag the ones to win back, and a re-activation workflow writes to them before the season, then leaves them alone.

00:02:06.488 --> 00:02:18.754
Every inquiry captured with its source, every estimate followed up, every visit confirmed, and every job tracked to the payment. Book an HVAC growth consultation at protectedcentral.com/hvac.
